:"c-sanguozhi-053-zhanghong:line016","quote":"　　紘建計宜出都秣陵，權從之。令還吳迎家，道病卒。臨困，授子靖留箋曰：「自古有國有家者，咸欲修德政以比隆盛世，至於其治，多不馨香。非無忠臣賢佐暗於治體也，由主不勝其情，弗能用耳。夫人情憚難而趨易，好同而惡異，與治道相反。《傳》曰：『從善如登，從惡如崩』，言善之難也。人君承奕世之基，據自然之勢，操八柄之威，甘易同之歡，無假取於人；而忠臣挾難近之術，吐逆耳之言，其不合也，不亦宜乎！（雖）則有釁，巧辯緣間，眩於小忠，戀於恩愛，賢愚雜錯，長幼失敘，其所由來，情亂之也。故明君悟之，求賢如饑渴。受諫而不厭，抑情損欲，以義割恩，上無偏謬之授，下無冀之望。宜加三思，含垢藏疾，以成仁覆之大。」時年六十卒。權省書流涕。","source_term":"授子靖留箋"}],"source_assertion_id":"a-wu053-zhanghong-0","interpretation_note":"本句所記父子；識別後綴不表示長幼。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）"}}],"source_mention_summary":[{"source_id":"s-sanguozhi-053-zhanghong","work_id":"w-sanguozhi","book_id":"b-sanguozhi-053","chapter_id":"c-sanguozhi-053-zhanghong","raw_mention_count":1,"mention_ids":["c-sanguozhi-053-zhanghong:line016:m0030"],"paragraph_ids":["c-sanguozhi-053-zhanghong:line016"],"table_cell_ids":[],"occurrence_groups":[{"canonical_mention_id":"c-sanguozhi-053-zhanghong:line016:m0030","mention_ids":["c-sanguozhi-053-zhanghong:line016:m0030"],"kind":"paragraph"}],"mention_count":1,"duplicate_mention_count":0,"paragraph_occurrence_count":1,"table_occurrence_count":0,"passage_count":1,"passage_count_scope":"annotation_containers_not_independent_witness_passages","count_explanation":"1處獨立位置，1個原始錨點；0項為同底本同位置重出。頻次不是來源權威度。"}],"most_mentioned_source_ids":["s-sanguozhi-053-zhanghong"],"mention_count_policy":{"scope":"independent_fixed_witness_occurrences","raw_mentions_preserved":true,"passage_count_scope":"annotation_containers","explanation":"頻次依已驗同底本同位置去重；原始錨點完整保留，頻次不代表來源權威度。","included_kinds":["paragraph","table_cell"],"identity_policy":"contextual_provisional","ties":"all_maxima","frequency_is_not_authority":true},"kinship_interpretation_cases":[],"reported_variants":[],"family_tree_decisions":[],"preferred_relations":[{"id":"a-wu053-zhanghong-0","subject_person_id":"6bz_2xv_ow3_A","object_person_id":"6bz_2xv_ow3","predicate":"father","qualifiers":{"source_term":"授子靖留箋"},"evidence":[{"work_id":"w-sanguozhi","book_id":"b-sanguozhi-053","chapter_id":"c-sanguozhi-053-zhanghong","